Implemented deterministic per-sample `param_ranges` and `n_particles_distribution` sampling in `src/synthlab/processes/generate.py` and ensured `pattern_params` captures resolved values. QC now derives expected label ratios and count expectations from the input config, reports tolerance checks in `metrics/qc.json`, and adds ratio/count expectation columns to `metrics/label_summary.csv` via `src/synthlab/processes/qc.py`, with defaults in `conf/wafer_particles/qc/default.yaml`. Added coverage tests in `tests/test_T0302_label_distribution_control.py`.

